| `scripts/query_corpus.py --corpus` | string | `None` | a path ending in `wiki/corpus.json`, never with `--root` | `scripts/query_corpus.py` | the corpus, read only at its checkout's `wiki/corpus.json`: the directory that keeps it is the checkout whose files are read with it (`scripts/corpus_level.py` `checkout`), a relative path taken from the caller's directory; any other path, one that does not exist, or one given with `--root`, is refused with exit 2 | building the corpus: `scripts/jobs/build_corpus.py` | always |
